  %% ---------------- 关系 ----------------

  PatinaOpenTarget *-- HistoryOpenTarget
  OpenPatinaWindowCmd ..> PatinaOpenTarget : 入参
  OpenPatinaWindowCmd ..> ToolsNavigationState : 写 pending
  MainWindowTargetDto ..> MainWindowTarget : 序列化映射
  MainWindowTarget *-- ToolsSection
  MainWindowTarget *-- HistoryTarget
  ToolsNavigationState o-- MainWindowTarget
  TakeMainToolsTargetCmd ..> ToolsNavigationState : take()
  HistoryTarget ..> History : dateKey + focusApp 落点

  ThemeChanged *-- AccentColors
  HostThemeGateway ..> ThemeChanged : listen / accent_get
  UseHostTheme ..> HostThemeGateway
  UseHostTheme ..> HostTheme
  ApplyDocumentTheme ..> DeriveTheme : 生产 28 键
  ApplyDocumentTheme ..> HostAccentBridge : 覆盖 8 键
  HostAccentBridge ..> DeriveTheme : 复用 primaryButtonBackground
  HostThemeMode ..> HostThemeGateway : ACL 放行

  TimerState *-- TimeRecord
  HostTimerGateway ..> TimerState : listen
  HostTimerGateway ..> TimeRecord : 时间字段
  UseHostTimerState ..> HostTimerGateway
  UseHostTimerState ..> HostTimerView
  TimingCapsule ..> UseHostTimerState
  TimingCapsule ..> HostIntentGateway
  HostTimingStatusRow ..> UseHostTimerState
  HostTimingStatusRow ..> HostIntentGateway
  HostIntentGateway ..> HostIntent : emitTo("main")
  HostIntentBridge ..> HostIntent : listen
  HostIntentBridge ..> IpcApi : start_timer / create_item / pause / resume

  HistoryTimelineViewModel *-- HistoryTimelineSegment
  HistoryTimingLane ..> HistoryTimelineViewModel : 同视口同轴
  HistoryTimingLane ..> UseTimingSegments
  UseTimingSegments ..> TimingLaneSegments
  UseTimingSegments ..> TimingRecordSlice : list_records
  TimingLaneSegments ..> TimingLaneSegment
  TimingLaneSegments ..> HistoryTimelineViewModel : 复用比例公式
  HistoryHorizontalTimeline ..> HistoryTimelineSegment
  HistoryHorizontalTimeline ..> HistoryTimingLane : 同卡片第二条轨
  History --> HistoryHorizontalTimeline
  History --> HistoryActivityActionDialog
  History --> UseHistoryDistributionItems
  HistoryActivityActionDialog ..> HostIntentGateway : start_timer_for_activity
  HistoryActivityActionDialog ..> HostTimerView : 已计时先问

  PillBar --> TodayEntry
  TodayEntry ..> TodayActions
  TodayActions ..> DateKey
  TodayActions ..> IpcApi : openPatinaWindow(target)
  RecordsPanel --> ActivityStrip
  RecordsPanel ..> TodayActions
  ActivityStrip ..> TodayActions : chip → focusApp
